OL,5,G1300 Craig Charles
OL,6,     FThe weekend is basically here, so
OL,7,     FCraig is giving you permission to
OL,8,     Fstart the party early... That's
OL,9,     Fright, let's Down Tools with loads
OL,10,     Fof amazing tunes to get us going.
OL,11,G1600 Huw Stephens
OL,12,     FIt's Friday, so Huw is out to
OL,13,     Fprove that any song sounds better
OL,14,     Fwhen it's played on 6 Music by Huw
OL,15,     FStephens - so let us know what you
OL,16,     Fwant to hear.
