OL,5,G2300 The 6 Mix with Mary Anne Hobbs
OL,6,     FThis week, we welcome
OL,7,     FManchester-based DJ and producer
OL,8,     FAnz to the 6 Mix.
OL,9,G0000 6 Music's Rave Forever
OL,10,     FBoogie down to the sounds of Italo
OL,11,     Fdisco, new wave and funk.
OL,12,G0100 Forever Dark
OL,13,     F6 Music takes you to the dark side
OL,14,     Fwith the finest goth, electronic
OL,15,     Fand dark pop music.
OL,16,G0200 Focus Beats
OL,17,     FSoundtrack your focus time with
OL,18,     Ftwo hours of hand-picked
OL,19,     Finstrumentals. Including music
OL,20,     Ffrom Lauryn Hill, Headache, Werkha
OL,21,     Fand Yazmin Lacey.
